  pageTitle: "\u201CPrayer of the Harvest\u201D"
  pageBody: "\r\nThe rice is not merely food. It is a prayer standing upright in
    the wind.\n\r\nEach cut of the harvest feels like a whispered thanks\u2026\r\nand
    a silent plea for enough strength to finish the day."
